{"id":318,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield"],"text":"These Pokémon have sharp fangs and powerful jaws. Sailors avoid Carvanha dens at all costs."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It won’t attack while it’s alone—not even if it spots prey. Instead, it waits for other Carvanha to join it, and then the Pokémon attack as a group."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"With its sturdy jaws and fangs, it can easily chomp wooden boats to splinters. It fights with Basculin over food."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"They’re such cowards that they won’t hunt alone. When five or so of them get together, they suddenly turn ferocious!"},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"If they scent the faintest trace of blood, they rush to attack en masse. When alone, they’re rather cowardly."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Each school has its own territory. Any intruders are mercilessly attacked with fangs bared."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"If anything invades Carvanha’s territory, it will swarm and tear at the intruder with its pointed fangs. On its own, however, this Pokémon turns suddenly timid."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Carvanha’s strongly developed jaws and its sharply pointed fangs pack the destructive power to rip out boat hulls. Many boats have been attacked and sunk by this Pokémon."},{"games":["Y","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It lives in massive rivers that course through jungles. It swarms prey that enter its territory."},{"games":["X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"They form packs to attack boats and rip out their hulls to sink them. They live in rivers in the jungle."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"They swarm any foe that invades their territory. Their sharp fangs can tear out boat hulls."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"CARVANHA attack ships in swarms, making them sink. Although it is said to be a very vicious POKéMON, it timidly flees as soon as it finds itself alone."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Rough Skin","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's rough skin damages attackers that make direct contact with it."},{"name":"Speed Boost","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's Speed stat is boosted every turn."}],"eggGroups":["Water 2"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":35,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":"sea","color":"Red","shape":"Fish","evolution":{"id":318,"name":"Carvanha","condition":null,"children":[{"id":319,"name":"Sharpedo","condition":"Lv. 30","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,43],[1,453],[4,305],[8,116],[12,184],[16,44],[20,423],[24,103],[28,207],[32,242],[36,97],[40,710],[44,36]],"machine":[97,372,213,59,340,362,242,399,291,203,263,116,258,56,58,423,196,710,371,182,706,240,156,514,496,503,184,103,214,555,173,164,57,129,269,168,253,127,250,428],"egg":[246,194,38,37,352],"tutor":[812,799]},"cards":[{"id":"me2-60","name":"Carvanha","set":"Phantasmal Flames","date":"2025-11-14","rarity":"Common","number":"60","artist":"Shin Nagasawa","img":"me2/60"},{"id":"sv5-42","name":"Carvanha","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"42","artist":"Souichirou Gunjima","img":"sv5/42"},{"id":"sv3-46","name":"Carvanha","set":"Obsidian Flames","date":"2023-08-11","rarity":"Common","number":"46","artist":"Jerky","img":"sv3/46"},{"id":"svp-93","name":"Carvanha","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"93","artist":"Tonji Matsuno","img":"svp/93"},{"id":"swsh8-162","name":"Carvanha","set":"Fusion Strike","date":"2021-11-12","rarity":"Common","number":"162","artist":"NC Empire","img":"swsh8/162"},{"id":"swsh7-35","name":"Carvanha","set":"Evolving Skies","date":"2021-08-27","rarity":"Common","number":"35","artist":"Kyoko Umemoto","img":"swsh7/35"},{"id":"swsh35-11","name":"Carvanha","set":"Champion's Path","date":"2020-09-25","rarity":"Common","number":"11","artist":"Shigenori Negishi","img":"swsh35/11"},{"id":"sm12-132","name":"Carvanha","set":"Cosmic Eclipse","date":"2